            <ArticleTitle>Paraganglioma of the filum terminale.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>584-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Paraganglioma of the filum terminale is rare. The authors report a case of paraganglioma of the filum terminale presenting with paraparesis on a background of spastic quadriparesis. The clinical presentation, radiological findings and current literature are presented.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
